    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME introduced a one-day simulation workshop on TURP (Transurethral Resection of the Prostate) and TURB (Transurethral Resection of Bladder). Transurethral surgery is a very common procedure, but like all surgery, complications can arise. It requires accurate hand-eye coordination and fine motor movements for the handling of delicate instruments. It is difficult to learn, hence requires practice as the slightest error can lead to complications.",
